ls for implementation. Another typical use cases, more from power users, is using large context models for analyzing codebase context for planning.\n\nDeep research is another use case, but we don't offer models for this yet.\n\nAs we get custom modes; this would one area to start some experimentation. Maybe the high/low levers are _\"context size\"_ and _\"reasoning\"_:\n\nExplain/document simple code: Low context, low reasoning.\nWrite tests for complex logic: Medium context, high reasoning.\n_… other scenarios?_","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/2790725165/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}